{"id":"657901","name":"紫菜虾滑肉饼","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657901/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾滑","amount":"（安井虾滑）适量"},{"name":"肉丸酱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"紫菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"热锅放入紫菜，将紫菜两面烘至变绿色。","img":"images/657901/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"烘过的紫菜放入保鲜袋，把它捏碎。","img":"images/657901/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"碗中放入生的肉丸酱。","img":"images/657901/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入虾滑。","img":"images/657901/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入紫菜。","img":"images/657901/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"混合抓拌均匀。","img":"images/657901/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一小部分肉酱捏圆后再按压成饼状。","img":"images/657901/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中热油放入肉饼。","img":"images/657901/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"小火将两面煎至金黄即可。","img":"images/657901/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎好的肉饼一口咬下爆汁。","img":"images/657901/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657901/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657901/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657901/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657901/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657901/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}